# Uldaros Theorix: a player may give up a cast (CR 733.1) and it is undone as if never begun. Bot1 exiles Black Lotus, Tarfire,
# Dark Ritual, Jace and Mind Twist (as in the neighbouring scenario), starts casting the Tarfire copy and cancels at its
# target. Nothing was cast, so nothing counts towards the six: Jace (4), Mind Twist (1) and Dark Ritual (1) are cast for 6
# in all, and the Lotus (0). The Tarfire (1) is then over the six and is not offered again. Bot2 is not hit by it.

